  "Description": "The A-User Formation (PGM-AUF) AIM forms the Portable Avatar that utters the A-User's response. It combines the deliberated communicative content (the Final Response produced by Basic Knowledge) with the A-User State produced by Personality Alignment. The Portable Avatar expresses the A-User's Personal Status across speech, face, and body. A-User Formation is driven by the AUC-AUF Request of A-User Control. The A-User State conveys the full Entity State of the A-User; the current A-User Formation SubAIMs consume only its Personal Status component, since the speech, face, and body rendering Sub",
